    {
      "id": "4.49.4",
      "label": "4.49.4",
      "numbers": [
        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "कालः च नः महान् यातः सुग्रीवः च उग्र शासनः |\nतस्मात् भवन्तः सहिता विचिन्वन्तु समंततः",
      "iast": "kālaḥ ca naḥ mahān yātaḥ sugrīvaḥ ca ugra śāsanaḥ |\ntasmāt bhavantaḥ sahitā vicinvantu samaṃtataḥ",
      "translation": "\"We started a long time back and a great deal of time is lapsed, and Sugreeva is a severe disciplinarian, therefore let the search continued everywhere collectively.",
