    {
      "id": "4.49.6",
      "label": "4.49.6",
      "numbers": [
        6
      ],
      "devanagari": "अनिर्वेदम् च दाक्ष्यम् च मनसः च अपराजयम् |\nकार्य सिद्धि कराणि आहुः तस्मात् एतत् ब्रवीमि अहम्",
      "iast": "anir.hvedam ca dākṣyam ca manasaḥ ca aparājayam |\nkārya siddhi karāṇi āhuḥ tasmāt etat bravīmi aham",
      "translation": "\"Insistency, ingenuity and indomitability of heart are said to be the causes for achieving results, therefore I am speaking all this.",
      "notes": [
        "Relentless efforts will bring the fruits of pursuit. On taking up an activity it is to be continued without abandoning for reasons of personal disinterestedness or laxity. <em>anena anirvedādayaḥ kārya siddhikarā iti uktam - tathā ca - bhārate - udyoge viduraḥ - anirvedaḥ śriyo mūlam dharmasya ca | mahān bhavati anirvisaṇṇo bhayam na mahat dṛccati | - dk</em>"
      ],
      "glosses": [
        {
