    {
      "id": "4.49.9",
      "label": "4.49.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "सुग्रीवः क्रोधनो राजा तीक्ष्ण दण्डः च वानराः |\nभेतव्यम् तस्य सततम् रामस्य च महात्मनः",
      "iast": "sugrīvaḥ krodhano rājā tīkṣṇa daṇḍaḥ ca vānarāḥ |\nbhetavyam tasya satatam rāmasya ca mahātmanaḥ",
      "translation": "\"King Sugreeva is irascible and he is a ruthful persecutor too, oh, vanara-s, we shall always be frightened of him, and of self-reliant Rama as well.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "vaanaraaH",
          "iast": "vānarāḥ",
          "devanagari": "वानराः",
          "meaning": "oh, vanara-s",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 6
        },
        {
