    {
      "id": "4.49.10",
      "label": "4.49.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "हितार्थम् एतत् उक्तम् वः क्रियताम् यदि रोचते |\nउच्यताम् हि क्षमम् यत् तत् सर्वेषाम् एव वानराः",
      "iast": "hitārtham etat uktam vaḥ kriyatām yadi rocate |\nucyatām hi kṣamam yat tat sarveṣām eva vānarāḥ",
      "translation": "\"All this is being said in the interest of your well-being, and if it is obliging to you it may be done in this way as I have said, if not, any other way out is there which will be conducive for all of us, oh, vanara-s, it may be said.\" Thus Angada spoke to the troops of monkeys.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
