    {
      "id": "4.49.12",
      "label": "4.49.12",
      "numbers": [
        12
      ],
      "devanagari": "सदृशम् खलु वः वाक्यम् अंगदो यत् उवाच ह |\nहितम् च एव अनुकूलम् च क्रियताम् अस्य भाषितम्",
      "iast": "sadṛśam khalu vaḥ vākyam aṃgado yat uvāca ha |\nhitam ca eva anukūlam ca kriyatām asya bhāṣitam",
      "translation": "\"What Angada has said that is indeed appropriate, isn't it! It is advantageous and pragmatic also. Let us carry out as said by him.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "angadaH yat vaakyam uvaaca ha",
          "iast": "angadaḥ yat vākyam uvāca ha",
