    {
      "id": "4.49.13",
      "label": "4.49.13",
      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "पुनः मार्गामहे शैलान् कन्दराम् च शिलान् तथा |\nकाननानि च शून्यानि गिरि प्रस्रवणानि च",
      "iast": "punaḥ mārgāmahe śailān kandarām ca śilān tathā |\nkānanāni ca śūnyāni giri prasravaṇāni ca",
      "translation": "\"Again let us search out mountains, caves, crags, also like that the uninhabited forests and mountain rapids, too.",
