    {
      "id": "4.49.14",
      "label": "4.49.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "यथा उद्दिष्ठानि सर्वाणि सुग्रीवेण महात्मना |\nविचिन्वन्तु वनम् सर्वे गिरि दुर्गाणि संगताः",
      "iast": "yathā uddiṣṭhāni sar.hvāṇi sugrīveṇa mahātmanā |\nvicinvantu vanam sarve giri dur.hgāṇi saṃgatāḥ",
      "translation": "\"Let us all collectively search all of the places with forests, mountains and gorges as indicated by that self-assertive Sugreeva.\" Thus Gandhamaadana spoke to all monkeys.",
