    {
      "id": "4.49.18",
      "label": "4.49.18",
      "numbers": [
        18
      ],
      "devanagari": "तस्य अग्रम् अधिरूढाः ते श्रान्ता विपुल विक्रमाः |\nन पश्यन्ति स्म वैदेहीम् रामस्य महिषीम् प्रियाम्",
      "iast": "tasya agram adhirūḍhāḥ te śrāntā vipula vikramāḥ |\nna paśyanti sma vaidehīm rāmasya mahiṣīm priyām",
      "translation": "Though they searched everywhere on ascending the mountaintop they have not found Seetha, the dear queen of Rama, and though they are immensely venturesome they are fatigued.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "tasya agram adhiruuDhaaH",
          "iast": "tasya agram adhirūḍhāḥ",
          "devanagari": "तस्य अग्रं अधिरूढाः",
          "meaning": "its [mountain's,] top, on ascending",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "vipula vikramaaH te",
          "iast": "vipula vikramāḥ te",
          "devanagari": "विपुल विक्रमाः ते",
          "meaning": "[though] immensely, venturesome, they the vanara-s",
